                                                "sense_id": "195eacc6-a933-32c4-b1a5-90d9706bd93c",
                                                "text": "\"What have you been doing lately?\" — \"Oh, you know, this and that.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c959f370-a7b0-40d8-9108-f35f7499b67b",
                                                "sense_id": "195eacc6-a933-32c4-b1a5-90d9706bd93c",
                                                "text": "It’s amusing to learn from publicists and Meghan herself that the duchess’s artisan this-and-thats will be available in the Netflix brick-and-mortar stores opening this year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
